      {
       "html": "<p align=\"center\"><b><font size=\"+2\">Social Event: Drinks and Food</span></b></p>\n\t\t<p align=\"center\"><font size=\"+2\">at <a href=\"\"><b>Ninkasi Saint Paul</b></a></span></p>\n                <p align=\"center\">5 Rue Octavio Mey, at the northern end of Lyon's historic Old Town district. (<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/BtLj9xNKxgTA6VkA6\">map</a>)</p>\n\t\t<p align=\"center\">Both drinks and food will be provided, incl. vegetarian options (thanks to our sponsors!)</p>\n\t\t<p align=\"center\">Please don't forget to bring your badge. If you would like to bring a +1 please let us know when picking up your badge in the morning.</p>\n\t\t<p align=\"center\">\n                  We will have two private areas at the venue - upstairs and downstairs, but\n                  part of the venue around the bar will be open to the public. There won't be\n                  a cloakroom where you can leave your jackets/bags and neither we<br/> nor the bar\n                  will take responsibility for any lost or damaged items, so you may want to\n                  drop off your gear at the hotel before you head there.\n                </p>\n\t\t<p align=\"center\">\n                    <iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d11133.746351480799!2d4.824974105373568!3d45.762439990062454!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0%3A0xe2db883c8ef1625!2sNinkasi%20SAINT%20PAUL!5e0!3m2!1sen!2suk!4v1571700684610!5m2!1sen!2suk\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" frameborder=\"0\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"1\"></iframe>\n                </p>",
